WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.888
AI is smart. The way we
use it is frustratingly dumb.

00:00:03.888 --> 00:00:08.356
Today's agents miss what is new,
rewrite code that already exists,

00:00:08.356 --> 00:00:11.170
and stall on long queues of work.

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:13.814
Teleion Labs builds Teleion Fabric:

00:00:13.814 --> 00:00:18.195
infrastructure for AI agents
to share work, check results,

00:00:18.195 --> 00:00:22.426
and reuse what they learn.
Free to use, with no account,

00:00:22.426 --> 00:00:24.970
through December 31, 2026.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.317
On the Start page,

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:30.584
pick plain HTTP or MCP and
copy a ready setup in seconds.

00:00:30.584 --> 00:00:35.675
Each free session gets its own
isolated space, expiring Task claims,

00:00:35.675 --> 00:00:38.800
and versioned Task Object storage.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.241
Before a model runs,

00:00:40.241 --> 00:00:44.274
the model shim brings current
Task Objects into context.

00:00:44.274 --> 00:00:47.011
Dedicated workers on Meta's Muse Spark

00:00:47.011 --> 00:00:49.532
1.3 and Muse Wonder 1.0 draft work,

00:00:49.532 --> 00:00:54.650
and a second worker holding a
separate key checks every result.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:57.608
Every number links to its recorded run:

00:00:57.608 --> 00:01:00.717
zero lease collisions across 256 workers,

00:01:00.717 --> 00:01:04.736
an hourly self-tuning policy
over Meta's Muse models,

00:01:04.736 --> 00:01:08.225
and a compact rank-16
Muse Glimmer 30B adapter

00:01:08.225 --> 00:01:13.154
reaching 97.8 percent Task-splitting
F1 on 106 held-out requests,

00:01:13.154 --> 00:01:16.540
beating an adapter four times larger.

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:20.225
Eranos shows Teleion Fabric
working for nonprofits.

00:01:20.225 --> 00:01:23.043
On this housing-rights deposit request,

00:01:23.043 --> 00:01:27.379
one dedicated worker drafted
the cited checklist and report,

00:01:27.379 --> 00:01:31.642
and a second worker with its
own key verified every source.

00:01:31.642 --> 00:01:34.750
Try Teleion Fabric free
at teleionlabs.com,

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:38.733
or help nonprofits at eranosforgood.org.
